{"text":"Day seven. Pip doesn't run anymore. He's waiting at the entrance in the morning. You split your last chocolate with him, and you dig. By noon, the blisters have burst. Your palms are raw and bleeding into the clay. And you know a hand that breaks today digs nothing tomorrow. So you stop. Even with three days left. Even if the end is coming anyway. For one afternoon, you rest.","alignment":{"characters":["D","a","y"," ","s","e","v","e","n","."," ","P","i","p"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","r","u","n"," ","a","n","y","m","o","r","e","."," ","H","e","'","s"," ","w","a","i","t","i","n","g"," ","a","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","n","t","r","a","n","c","e"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","s","p","l","i","t"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","l","a","s","t"," ","c","h","o","c","o","l","a","t","e"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","h","i","m",","," ","a","n","d"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","i","g","."," ","B","y"," ","n","o","o","n",","," ","t","h","e"," ","b","l","i","s","t","e","r","s"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","b","u","r","s","t","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","p","a","l","m","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","r","a","w"," ","a","n","d"," ","b","l","e","e","d","i","n","g"," ","i","n","t","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","c","l","a","y","."," ","A","n","d"," ","y","o","u"," ","k","n","o","w"," ","a"," ","h","a","n","d"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","b","r","e","a","k","s"," ","t","o","d","a","y"," ","d","i","g","s"," ","n","o","t","h","i","n","g"," ","t","o","m","o","r","r","o","w","."," ","S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","s","t","o","p","."," ","E","v","e","n"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","t","h","r","e","e"," ","d","a","y","s"," ","l","e","f","t","."," ","E","v","e","n"," ","i","f"," ","t","h","e"," ","e","n","d"," ","i","s"," ","c","o","m","i","n","g"," ","a","n","y","w","a","y","."," ","F","o","r"," ","o","n","e"," ","a","f","t","e","r","n","o","o","n",","," ","y","o","u"," ","r","e","s","t","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.104,0.186,0.221,0.313,0.372,0.511,